{"id":18911,"path":"/grammar-points/a1/conjunctions_and-but-or-so-because/","parentId":540,"order":240,"section":"grammar-points","level":"a1","depth":3,"title":"Conjunctions: And, but, or, so, because","seo":{"title":"Conjunctions: And, but, or, so, because - Test-English","description":"Ace the conjunctions 'and', 'but', 'or', 'so', 'because' in English with a clear grammar explanation and chart, and three exercises with key.","image":"/media/uploads/A1%E2%80%93Grammar_Conjunctions_and-but-or-so-because.jpg"},"modified":"2026-02-19T09:52:32","kind":"lesson","parts":["<h3>Exercise 1</h3> <h5>Choose <em>and, but, or, so, because</em> to complete each sentence.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"669\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 2</h3> <h5>Choose <em>and, but, or, so, because</em> to complete these sentences.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"670\"></div>","<h3>Exercise 3</h3> <h2>Conjunctions: And, but, or, so, because</h2> <h5>Fill in each gap using one of these conjunctions: <em>and, but, or, so, because</em>.</h5> <div data-quiz=\"671\"></div>"],"explanation":"<h2>And, but, or, so, because: Grammar chart</h2> <p><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-18952\" src=\"/media/uploads/Conjunctions-and-but_or-so_because.jpg\" alt=\"Grammar chart explaining the use of conjunctions 'and', 'but', 'or', 'so', 'because' with examples for each.\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\"></p> <h6></h6> <h2>And</h2> <p>We use <strong>and</strong> for adding <strong>similar information</strong> or ideas; it means ‘too’ or ‘in addition’.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>My brother is a plumber, <span><strong>and</strong></span> my sister is a teacher.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>They have an apartment in the city <span><strong>and</strong></span> a little house in the countryside.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <p>When we are connecting sentences, we don’t need to repeat the subject (<strong>Tom, I, we, she, etc.</strong>)</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>She got up <span><strong>and</strong></span> left</em>. (=She got up and she left.)</li> <li><em>He was looking at us <span><strong>and</strong></span> smiling.</em> (=He was looking at us and he was smiling.)</li> </ul> <h2>But</h2> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>but</strong> for adding <strong>contrasting information</strong>, i.e. information that is different.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I studied a lot, <span><strong>but</strong></span> I failed the exam.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>He is good <strong><span>but</span></strong> not the best.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></li> </ul> <h2>Or</h2> <p>We use&nbsp;<strong>or</strong> to connect <strong>different possibilities</strong>.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>Would you like to go to the swimming pool <span><strong>or</strong></span> to the beach?</em></li> <li><em>He can go to a hotel <span><strong>or</strong></span>&nbsp;stay with us.</em></li> </ul> <p>We use <strong>or</strong> (NOT <strong>and</strong>) in negative sentences to mean ‘not one thing and not another thing’.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I <span><strong>don’t</strong></span> like oranges <span><strong>and</strong></span> lemons</em><span><em>. </em></span><img class=\"alignnone size-full\" src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/wrong.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\"></li> <li><em><span><span>I</span> <strong>don’t</strong> <span>like oranges</span> <strong>or</strong> <span>lemons</span>. <span><img class=\"alignnone size-full\" src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/correct.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></em></li> </ul> <h4>Use <strong>and, but, or</strong> to connect similar words or phrases.</h4> <p>The items that we connect with <strong>and, but, or</strong> should be the same grammar type. Check these common mistakes:</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I like <span><strong>dancing </strong></span></em><span><em><strong>and</strong> <strong>sing</strong>. <img class=\"alignnone size-full\" src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/wrong.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></span></li> <li><em><span><span>I like danc</span><strong>ing and</strong> <span>sing</span><strong>ing</strong><span>.</span> <span><img class=\"alignnone size-full\" src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/correct.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\"> </span></span></em><span><span>(-ing verb <strong>and </strong>-ing verb)</span></span></li> <li><span><em><span>Would you like <span><strong>to go</strong></span> to the beach</span> <strong>or</strong><span><span><strong> having</strong></span> an ice cream in the park?</span> <img class=\"alignnone size-full\" src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/wrong.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\"></em></span></li> <li><em><span><span>Would you like</span> <strong>to go</strong><span> to the beach</span> <strong>or</strong> <strong>to have</strong> <span>an ice cream in the park?</span> <span><img class=\"alignnone size-full\" src=\"/media/wp-content/plugins/watupro/correct.png\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\"> </span></span></em><span><span>(to-infinitive <strong>and</strong> to-infinitive)</span></span></li> </ul> <h2>So</h2> <p>We use <strong>so</strong> to introduce the <strong>consequence</strong> or the <strong>result</strong> of something. The second part of the sentence is the result of the first part of the sentence.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>It was cold, <strong><span>so</span></strong> I turned on the heating.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I spent three hours at the gym, <strong><span>so</span></strong>&nbsp;I’m really tired now.</em></li> </ul> <h2>Because</h2> <p>We use <strong>because</strong> to introduce the <strong>reason</strong> for something.</p> <ul class=\"grammar-ex\"> <li><em>I turned on the heating <span><strong>because</strong></span> it was cold.&nbsp;</em></li> <li><em>I’m speaking quietly <span><strong>because</strong></span>&nbsp;I don’t want to wake up the baby.&nbsp;</em></li> </ul>","quizzes":[{"id":669,"questions":[{"id":5725,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I called Tom, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> he didn't answer. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["so","or","but","because"]}]},{"id":5726,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm tired <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I went to bed very late. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["but","and","so","because"]}]},{"id":5727,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>It was very late, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> we took a taxi. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["or","but","because","so"]}]},{"id":5730,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>You can go by bus <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> by train. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["because","but","so","or"]}]},{"id":5734,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She got into the car <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> left. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["or","and","but","so"]}]},{"id":5731,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I called you <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I was worried. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["and","but","so","because"]}]},{"id":5729,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Would you like to do it now <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> later?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["so","and","but","or"]}]},{"id":5732,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>She can sing, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> she can't dance. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["but","and","so","or"]}]},{"id":5728,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I wasn't hungry, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I didn't eat. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["so","or","but","because"]}]},{"id":5733,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I have one brother <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> two sisters. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"select","options":["but","and","or","so"]}]}]},{"id":670,"questions":[{"id":5735,"num":"1","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I don't have any brothers _____ sisters. I'm an only child. </div>","choices":[{"id":9232,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>or</span>"},{"id":9233,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9234,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>but</span>"},{"id":9235,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>because</span>"}]},{"id":5736,"num":"2","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I get home at around 7 p.m., _____ then I make dinner. </div>","choices":[{"id":9236,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>but</span>"},{"id":9237,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9238,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>or</span>"},{"id":9239,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>because</span>"}]},{"id":5738,"num":"3","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>It's raining, _____ we should take our umbrellas. </div>","choices":[{"id":9244,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9245,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>but</span>"},{"id":9246,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>because</span>"},{"id":9247,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>so</span>"}]},{"id":5739,"num":"4","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>She went home _____ she wasn't feeling very well. </div>","choices":[{"id":9248,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>because</span>"},{"id":9249,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9250,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>but</span>"},{"id":9251,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>so</span>"}]},{"id":5740,"num":"5","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We had a little accident, _____ everybody is OK. </div>","choices":[{"id":9252,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9253,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>but</span>"},{"id":9254,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>or</span>"},{"id":9255,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>so</span>"}]},{"id":5737,"num":"6","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I bought a pair of shoes in the sales, _____ my wife bought a new dress. </div>","choices":[{"id":9240,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>because</span>"},{"id":9241,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>or</span>"},{"id":9242,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9243,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>but</span>"}]},{"id":5741,"num":"7","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>It was a fantastic opportunity, _____ I decided to take it.</div>","choices":[{"id":9256,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>because</span>"},{"id":9257,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>or</span>"},{"id":9258,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>so</span>"},{"id":9259,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>and</span>"}]},{"id":5742,"num":"8","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I didn't tell you the truth _____ I didn't want to hurt your feelings.</div>","choices":[{"id":9260,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>so</span>"},{"id":9261,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>because</span>"},{"id":9262,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9263,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>but</span>"}]},{"id":5743,"num":"9","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>I hated the present, _____ I said it was great. </div>","choices":[{"id":9264,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>so</span>"},{"id":9265,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>or</span>"},{"id":9266,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>because</span>"},{"id":9267,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>but</span>"}]},{"id":5744,"num":"10","type":"radio","prompt":"<div>We can do it now _____ after lunch. </div>","choices":[{"id":9268,"letter":"A.","html":"<span>or</span>"},{"id":9269,"letter":"B.","html":"<span>but</span>"},{"id":9270,"letter":"C.","html":"<span>and</span>"},{"id":9271,"letter":"D.","html":"<span>because</span>"}]}]},{"id":671,"questions":[{"id":5745,"num":"1","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I have a car, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I never drive to work <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> the tube is faster. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5750,"num":"2","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>We couldn't do any shopping <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> it was a holiday. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5747,"num":"3","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Junk food is delicious <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> very unhealthy, <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> you should not eat it very often. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5751,"num":"4","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I knew Sara could help me, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I asked her for help. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5753,"num":"5","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>Would you like to watch a film at home <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> to go to the movies?</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5748,"num":"6","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I wasn't feeling well, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I went to the doctor, <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> he told me that I need to start a diet. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5746,"num":"7","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>I'm from the UK, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> I live in the US <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> my wife is American. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5752,"num":"8","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>He's a great person, <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> he's totally crazy.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5749,"num":"9","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>My brother is easy-going <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> positive, <span data-gap=\"1\"></span> my sister is very pessimistic. </p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"},{"kind":"text"}]},{"id":5754,"num":"10","type":"gaps","prompt":"<p>The city is expensive. You should rent a room in a shared flat <span data-gap=\"0\"></span> a small studio.</p>","gaps":[{"kind":"text"}]}]}]}